OKE Deployment Flow
This diagram shows the simple traffic flow used in this learning repository.
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[External User] --> B[OCI Load Balancer]
    B --> C[Ingress Controller]
    C --> D[Kubernetes Service - ClusterIP]
    D --> E[OKE Worker Node 1 - NGINX Pod]
    D --> F[OKE Worker Node 2 - NGINX Pod]
```
The main point is that the application pod is not directly exposed to the external user. Traffic flows through the load balancer, ingress controller, and service before reaching the pods.
